Z||000010||grinthock||09-17-2001||05:07 PM||||The biggest complaint about my Fiero!! THE ****  BRAKES!!!<P>BUT there are solutions guys.  I havn't done any yet, but here is what I have been told...  <P>Vented Discs<BR>Perf Pads<BR>Stainless Lines -- NO FLEX<BR>Synthetic Fluid<P>I was told by one guy that all he did was stainless lines and synth fluid and he saw a huge diff...<P> I also got a ride in SlammedFiero's car with the big brake kit, THAT is a car that stops, his brakes are AMAZING, I have never been in a car (short of a ferrari) that stops like that.<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroworldbanner.gif"> </A> <BR>Fieroworld!  Home of my 87 GT and 85 GT<BR>Justin C.<BR>Engineer, Designer and<BR>Technical Trainer for Nortel Networks Business Products.||||reg||1
